{"channelId":"UCIqPlKwlqcn7Svup44SBrgA","row":["Albuquerque Cat Clinic",7,"Compassionate Care in a Feline-Friendly Environment\n\nAt Albuquerque Cat Clinic, we believe that the bond between cats and their caretakers is extremely special. We also believe that protecting and preserving our feline patients’ health, both physical and mental, is essential to the continuance of this bond.\n\nWe strive to continually exceed our clients’ expectations in the care and treatment of their feline companions. We recognize that visits to the veterinarian can be stressful for both cat and owner. We work diligently to provide a quiet, relaxing environment and excellent customer service in order to create an experience that is as pleasant as possible.\n- See more at: http://abqcatclinic.com/#sthash.Gu4LpBtg.dpuf","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIqPlKwlqcn7Svup44SBrgA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIqPlKwlqcn7Svup44SBrgA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:17:28.373Z","channelId":"UCIqPlKwlqcn7Svup44SBrgA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"95cf536520e671fcfd63eec7b9b8c8c183b41330760d6ca3f2daaca673182338","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"816736cb96861718c379eafd1f477433d5051ab7b72ecb9d1538ed7fb6343c8a"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIqPlKwlqcn7Svup44SBrgA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7,"raw":"7 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIqPlKwlqcn7Svup44SBrgA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:17:28.373Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":